stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: user text
  [*] --> proposal: ai or import
  draft --> confirmed: confirmCareerEvidence
  proposal --> confirmed: confirmCareerEvidence
  draft --> rejected: rejectCareerEvidence
  proposal --> rejected: rejectCareerEvidence
  confirmed --> confirmed: same value, no write
  rejected --> rejected: same value, no write

  note right of confirmed
    Factual claim.
    updatedAt equals confirmedAt.
    Statement, provenance, and createdAt stay.
  end note

  note right of rejected
    Retained. Not a fact.
    updatedAt equals rejectedAt.
    No path back to confirmed in this slice.
  end note
